        solution: `$P_A(B) = 1 - ${dec2(nonB)} = ${dec2(pBA)}$, puis $P(A \\cap B) = P(A) \\times P_A(B) = ${dec2(pA)} \\times ${dec2(pBA)} = ${dec2(inter)}$.`
