        solution: `$\\overrightarrow{MA} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{MB} = (\\overrightarrow{MI} + \\overrightarrow{IA}) \\cdot (\\overrightarrow{MI} - \\overrightarrow{IA}) = MI^2 - IA^2 = ${m * m} - ${h2} = ${rep}$.`
